          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "મૂકવું (mūkvũ) is a tadbhava. It comes from mukna, \"loosed\", a reconstructed form beside Sanskrit mukta, \"released\"; CDIAL glosses the Gujarati verb \"to let go, put, place\" (CDIAL 10157)."
